9ad2b6ba477e0024c227ee40", "file": "m_af_undriven.v", "netlist_sha256": ["42bfa116080a7803a3f99aea666cba28dde2bbcbe07ab94da3685dbd44e06cdc", "42bfa116080a7803a3f99aea666cba28dde2bbcbe07ab94da3685dbd44e06cdc"], "roles": ["M-x"], "source_sha256": "b77a2cb761e607a111af680900c82e7110aadbe5ce1e16b9be447c879a2bb740"}, "m_full_at_three": {"description": "AI-written (DEV-005). full = 1 when the occupancy after the edge is 3 or 4, instead of exactly 4. Breaks FIFO-028 ('full = 1 exactly when c = 4'). It changes the full output, which drivers sample and react to (FIFO-040, FIFO-041).", "diff_sha256": "294de969e32857b3c1b0c313869dd3d7006e27c5525717635b19a8566ff0e3e7", "file": "m_full_at_three.v", "netlist_sha256": ["2ef24e58a3843b2b4b5adacbf9224c6407c3823ab450d7a0aba90431d90da5c2", "2ef24e58a3843b2b4b5adacbf9224c6407c3823ab450d7a0aba90431d90da5c2"], "roles": ["M-full"], "source_sha256": "26782bb75f49822e67cc41658864abcd0b00c8d348e9b066fd4f17d20f160aa7"}, "m_rddata_idle": {"description": "AI-written (DEV-005). After a non-reset active edge at which no read occurs, rd_data is set to A5 instead of holding its value. rd_valid is unchanged and is 0 exactly after those edges (FIFO-021), where rd_data is don't-care (FIFO-022); reset edges, rd_valid, full, almost_full and empty are unchanged. So every change is in a don't-care output.", "diff_sha256": "1bfef1e14457988fbc07e52e21f8f30438a1ad4041fbbc960e2ec11deae5ab67", "file": "m_rddata_idle.v", "netlist_sha256": ["d331a0129617e66afe92e38143ebcad2f232e984f7cc9bebb6dd89eddd301948", "d331a0129617e66afe92e38143ebcad2f232e984f7cc9bebb6dd89eddd301948"], "roles": ["M-dontcare"], "source_sha256": "98c0b327d50f87174b3868a80c8d16290cd5a25a3fbc1cd0667ab796f3b3530a"}, "m_write_at_full": {"description": "AI-written (DEV-005). do_write is wr_en alone, so a write while full without a read is accepted instead of ignored. That input is illegal (FIFO-031, FIFO-041) and its behaviour is unspecified; under every legal input a write at full comes with a read (FIFO-030), so do_write is unchanged. The netlist differs, but no legal run, and so no run of the reference driver, gives a raw output divergence.", "diff_sha256": "b8617193e16d4c09a321cbb9c5562784b7318e00b1bf20b59adaacf188fa13f3", "file": "m_write_at_full.v", "netlist_sha256": ["063e9acafe244903a2f14c54487dd0450e3a27ca41c21806baa9069adc88a917", "063e9acafe244903a2f14c54487dd0450e3a27ca41c21806baa9069adc88a917"], "roles": ["M-silent"], "source_sha256": "9efd79c3115e5028420d0dad8cf7ed042dde50b2f51bf17c2b5b72a4caecabca"}}, "owner_artifacts": ["mutants/manifest.json"], "provisional": [], "seed": 0, "status": "PASS", "wall_s": 25.48}
